WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.220
Lunchtime. Ewa sits down in a small restaurant.

2
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.310
Dzień dobry. Co dla pani?

3
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.320
Co pan poleca?

4
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.830
She asks the waiter for advice.

5
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:18.320
Dzisiaj polecam zupę pomidorową i pierogi.

6
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.450
Dobrze, poproszę zupę i pierogi.

7
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.340
Coś do picia?

8
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.150
Wodę, proszę.

9
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.800
Proszę. Smacznego!

10
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.670
Poproszę zupę pomidorową.

11
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:38.150
Order with the polite word, then the dish.

12
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.180
A feminine dish changes its ending, and so does the word that describes it.

13
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.090
When you finish, ask for the bill in the same way.

14
00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.130
Ask the waiter what he recommends.

15
00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:57.490
Co pan poleca?

16
00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:02.050
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

17
00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.210
Co pan poleca?

18
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.730
Wish someone a good meal.

19
00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.010
Smacznego!

20
00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:18.570
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

21
00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.650
Smacznego!

22
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.410
You have finished. Ask for the bill.

23
00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:30.890
Poproszę rachunek.

24
00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.450
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

25
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.730
Poproszę rachunek.

26
00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:44.370
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
